  {
    "ref": "U00192",
    "text": "StaticText: Hair Building Fibers are ideal for anyone who wants to disguise the challenge of thinning hair. These keratin-derived fibers are safe and blend undetectably with your existing hair to create the appearance of thicker, fuller hair. Package Includes: (1) 15g Bottle of SureThik Hair Fibers (1) 3 fl. oz. Fiber Holding Spray Hair Fibers electro statically cling to your hair and scalp, covering any thin or balding areas. Gives the appearance of a full head of hair! Holding Spray an Alcohol Free finishing spray, enhances the bond between the hair fibers and your natural hair. Also adds shine. WHAT ELSE YOU NEED TO KNOW Ideal for both men and women Rain, wind and perspiration proof Compatible with hair loss medications No special hair styling products needed Available in virtually every hair color Washes out with shampoo"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00193",
    "text": "ListMarker: •"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00194",
    "text": "StaticText: Best Hair Fibers to cover up thin hair & bald spots for both Men & Women"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00195",
    "text": "ListMarker: •"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00196",
    "text": "StaticText: 100% Natural Looking Hair Thickening Powder, Made from Keratin Fibers + Alcohol Free Holding Spray locks fibers in place and adds a natural shine."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00197",
    "text": "ListMarker: •"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00198",
    "text": "StaticText: WIND, RAIN & SWEAT PROOF. WATER RESISTANT: Will not run when wet!"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00199",
    "text": "ListMarker: •"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00200",
    "text": "StaticText: Available in 8 natural colors"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00201",
    "text": "ListMarker: •"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00202",
    "text": "StaticText: Bundle includes 1 x 15g Hair Thickening Fiber & 1 x 3oz Holding Spray"
